@startuml
!include style.iuml
hide footbox
title REST integration patterns: safe retry of an allocation (UML 2.5.1 sequence diagram, as built)

actor ":IntegrationClient" as C
participant ":HttpExchangeAdapter" as HX
control ":FrontController" as FC
participant ":IdempotentHandler" as IH <<decorator>>
control ":ApiController" as AC
participant ":IdempotencyStore" as ST
participant ":AllocationService" as S <<facade + proxy>>

C -> HX : GET /api/v1/jobs/J-1106-02\nX-Request-Id: trace-0001
HX -> FC : Request
FC -> AC : job(request)
AC -> S : getJob(id)
S --> AC : job (version 4)
AC --> C : 200, ETag: "4", X-Request-Id: trace-0001

C -> HX : POST /api/v1/allocations\nIf-Match: "4", Idempotency-Key: k-42\n{jobId, workerId}
HX -> FC : Request
FC -> IH : handle(request)
IH -> ST : begin(scope, sha256(body))
ST --> IH : Started
IH -> AC : allocate(request)
AC -> S : allocate(jobId, workerId, 4)
S --> AC : allocation
AC --> IH : 201 Created, Location
IH -> ST : complete(scope, response copy)
IH --> C : 201 Created, Location: /api/v1/allocations/{id}

note over C : The response is lost (timeout).\nThe client retries with the SAME key.

C -> HX : POST /api/v1/allocations\nIf-Match: "4", Idempotency-Key: k-42
HX -> FC : Request
FC -> IH : handle(request)
IH -> ST : begin(scope, sha256(body))
ST --> IH : Replay(stored response)
IH --> C : 201 Created (same Location)\nIdempotent-Replayed: true

alt same key, different body
  ST --> IH : Mismatch
  IH --> C : 422 application/problem+json
else no key, stale If-Match
  AC --> C : 412 application/problem+json\n{type: /problems/precondition-failed, requestId}
end

note right of IH
  DECORATOR around the handler: idempotency is added
  without changing ApiController (Idempotent Receiver, EIP).
end note
@enduml
